# GMS gives no timing for this, and the data has none either: the summon's
# attack info has a hit count and a reach but no interval, so the client holds
# one constant for the whole family of old summons. Timed from a video at no
# more than once every 3 seconds, which matches Fiel's older measurement of the
# family.
#
# One enemy and one strike, which makes it a modest skill: the eye roams and
# picks its own target instead of joining the shout.
name: "Evil Eye of Domination"
description: "Your Evil Eye roams freely, attacking nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BERSERKER skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 10
max_enemies: 1
lines: 1
cast_interval_seconds: 3.0
base { skill_pct: 1.56 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.06 }
